id: zoom-new-page
section: Scrolling and gestures
item: A page zoomed in by a pinch: the next page opens at its own zoom, not the last one's
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-long-static.html
kit: cavekit-input-bridging.md R3
needs: internet
calibrate 'sel:#content p'
pinch 384 700 150 400
wait zoom 10
expect zoom-min 1.5
launch http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-card-events.html 40
wait still 0,100,756,600 6
expect zoom 1.0 0.05
launch https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/HP_TouchPad 60
wait still 0,100,756,600 20
expect zoom 0.69 0.06
